        "id": 1129199
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-12T10:33:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes but there can be only one driver? It seems incredibly fragile to allow board to override chip settings at runtime...",
      "parentUuid": "441fe33b_13e5fa35",
      "revId": "20cc71f25c6faedfac9d1f175325cadbd227c24f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
